    <!-- DataProtection moved off EF Core to Dapper in ADR-0022 Phase B — see
         Verbara.Platform.Identity.DataProtection.DapperXmlRepository. The
         Identity package now owns the persistence stack; Platform.Api just
         passes an NpgsqlDataSource via PlatformDataProtectionOptions.UsePostgres. -->
    <!-- QuestPDF, ScottPlot, MailKit moved to Platform.Renderer and Platform.Mail microservices -->
